<section class="hero">
  <h1>The Real Reason Eye Cream Never Fixed Your Under-Eyes <em>(It Isn't The Cream)</em></h1>
  <p class="byline">Skin &amp; Ageing Desk · <mark>[month, year]</mark> · 9 min read</p>
</section>

<div class="note">
<b>Fill-in brief — delete this box before publishing.</b><br><br>
<b>1. Citations.</b> Five numbered slots are built into the study-stack section below. Each states exactly what the citation must support and what to request. Claims 1, 2, 4 and 5 are general science and should be sourceable from published literature. <b>Slot 3 is the load-bearing one</b> — the whole mechanism rests on it.<br><br>
