      <p><strong>P.S.</strong> — I still use them twice a week. Not because I am worried it will come back, but because the mornings are simply easier and it costs me nothing to keep doing it.</p>
      <p style="margin:0"><strong>P.P.S.</strong> — If you have an event in the calendar, count backwards. Eight weeks minimum, and never start anything new on the eye area in the fortnight before the photographs. I nearly got that wrong.</p>
    </div>
